{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ghost-playback-023-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/GloopsEventSuppressionTests.cs","line":235,"method":"PurgeEventsForRecordings_RemovesForcedGloopsTaggedEvent_LiveAndSnapshot","category":"T3","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameStateStore.cs:502; drop the live-events removal loop -> red; deleting the milestone purge at :513 -> stays green","what_it_asserts":"One tagged live event is purged and its orphan contract snapshot is removed; return count is 1.","why_weak":"The lead comment claims the cell pins all three stores touched by PurgeEventsForRecordings, but no milestone is seeded so MilestoneStore.PurgeTaggedEvents (GameStateStore.cs:513) contributes 0 and cannot red the cell.","proposed_action":"Either seed a milestone carrying a gloops-tagged event and assert it is purged, or correct the comment to say live events plus contract snapshots only.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ghost-playback-023-02","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/WatchEntryAcceptanceWiringGateTests.cs","line":69,"method":"EveryConsumerReachesTheTermThroughTheOneFixedForwarder","category":"T4","severity":"Medium","confidence":"medium","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek.Tests/WatchEntryAcceptanceWiringGateTests.cs:281; a new consumer whose IsGhostOnBody( call sits after a string literal containing // on the same line -> gate stays green","what_it_asserts":"No file under Source/Parsek outside two exemptions contains the substring IsGhostOnBody( after line-comment stripping.","why_weak":"The gate DERIVES A SET from source text by substring scan. StripComments cuts each line at the first // (inside string literals too, a fail-green hole) and does not strip /* */ blocks (a fail-red hole). Project rule: set-deriving guards walk the AST.","proposed_action":"Replace the substring sweep with an AST/Roslyn invocation walk over Source/Parsek, keeping the same exemption set and message.","effort":"M","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"GameStateStore","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/GameStateStore.cs","sut_line":513,"case_kind":"integration","proposed_name":"PurgeEventsForRecordings_RemovesGloopsTaggedEventHeldInAMilestone","sketch":"Seed a milestone via MilestoneStore holding a gloops-tagged GameStateEvent, call PurgeEventsForRecordings with that id, assert the returned count includes the milestone row and the milestone no longer holds the event.","guards":"A regression that drops the MilestoneStore.PurgeTaggedEvents branch leaves the F5-then-discard path leaking ghost-only tagged events into the career state.","risk":"career"}
